{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_01",
      "hash": "6377cae5824865b1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "？？？『ほほうッ！\\nアポロを　まかしたか……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_02",
      "hash": "6377c7e582486098",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "こんな　ところ　まで　よくきた"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_05",
      "hash": "6377cee582486c7d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "せかい　じゅうの　ポケモンを\\nわるだくみに　つかい　まくって\\r\\nかねもうけ　する　ロケットだん！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_06",
      "hash": "6377cbe582486764",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "わたしが\\nその　リーダー　サカキだ！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_12",
      "hash": "637b51e5824b80ed",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……なに？　カラカラを\\nかえして　ほしい　だと？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0740_karakara_01",
      "hash": "23dd5c22364b2f1e",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "カラカラ『マァ　マァ！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_13",
      "hash": "637b50e5824b7f3a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "サカキ『フッハハハ！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_14",
      "hash": "637b4be5824b76bb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "まさか　それだけの　ために\\nアジトまで　のりこんで　くるとは"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_15",
      "hash": "637b4ae5824b7508",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "ずいぶん　おもしろい\\nこどもが　いるものだ……"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_07",
      "hash": "6377cce582486917",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "だが……　わたしに　はむかう　なら\\nいたい　めに　あって　もらう！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0740_dummy_01",
      "hash": "25781b19f3783aea",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[~ 10]"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_03",
      "hash": "6377c8e58248624b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "サカキ『わたしが　こどもに\\nまけて　しまうとはな！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_16",
      "hash": "637b4de5824b7a21",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "そこの　カラカラは\\nすきに　するがいい"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0740_karakara_02",
      "hash": "23dd5b22364b2d6b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "カラカラ『マァー！"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_08",
      "hash": "6377c1e582485666",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "そして　これも　とっておけ\\nこどもだと　バカにした　わびだ"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0740_sys_01",
      "hash": "cf2789eaf3ba5b91",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]は　サカキ　から\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]シルフスコープ[VAR COLOR(0000)]を　わたされた！"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_04",
      "hash": "6377cde582486aca",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……きみは　とても　だいじに\\nポケモンを　そだてて　いるな"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_09",
      "hash": "6377c2e582485819",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "だが　わたしの　かんがえは\\nとても　りかい　できないだろう"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_10",
      "hash": "637b4fe5824b7d87",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……！\\nここは　いちど　みを　ひこう！"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketboss_11",
      "hash": "637b4ee5824b7bd4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "きみとは　また　どこかで\\nたたかいたい　ものだ……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "id": "msg_main0740_karakara_03",
      "hash": "23dd5a22364b2bb8",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "カラカラ『マーアッフ！"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "id": "msg_main0740_sys_02",
      "hash": "cf2786eaf3ba5678",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "カラカラは　[VAR COLOR(0006)]シオンタウン[VAR COLOR(0000)]に\\nかえって　いった！"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "id": "msg_main0740_sys_03",
      "hash": "cf2787eaf3ba582b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "シルフスコープを　つかえば\\n[VAR COLOR(0006)]ゆうれい[VAR COLOR(0000)]の　しょうたいが\\r\\nわかる　かも……？"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "id": "msg_main0740_rocketchief_01",
      "hash": "931be10778a8be15",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "アポロ『……カラカラなら　かってに\\nかえった　ようですよ\\c\\nあなたも　さっさと　たちさって\\nシルフスコープの　つかいみち　でも\\r\\nかんがえたら　どうです？"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
